{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "94bf5424-a428-4fd2-9366-59485fd35538",
		"name": "TikTok Downloader - API Docs",
		"description": "## ☕ Quick Usage\n\n## Retrieving Post Information\n\nTo retrieve TikTok post information (supporting both video and slide photos), you can call the `/api/get?url={tiktok_url}` API endpoint using the GET method. Use response code checking to check success or failure for a short way. Or you can also see the detailed error message in the JSON response with the `error` key.\n\n## Convert Slide Image to Video\n\nThis API supports converting posts that contain images and songs, which will then be converted into videos according to the backsound in the post. You can call the API endpoint `/api/convert` using the **POST** method, the `token` body must be filled using a valid convert token using JSON. Convert token is the value of the JSON response with the `tokenConverter` key in the JSON response when you retrieve the post information.\n\n> ℹ️ **A post can only be converted if the post is an image/some image** with a backsound to the post. **Posts that are videos will not be converted**. To check whether a post can be converted, we can see the value of `availableImagesToVideo` when calling the `/api/get?url={tiktok_url}` API endpoint. \n  \n\n🛡️ Maintainer: [@Ihsan Devs](https://github.com/IhsanDevs)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.0.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "15428033"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Retrieving Post Information",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Response status code is 200\", function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Response has the required fields\", function () {",
							"    const responseData = pm.response.json();",
							"    ",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.be.an('object');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('author');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('desc');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('urlVideoDownload');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('urlAlbums');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('availableImagesToVideo');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('tokenConverter');",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Author field is a non-empty string\", function () {",
							"  const responseData = pm.response.json();",
							"  ",
							"  pm.expect(responseData).to.be.an('object');",
							"  pm.expect(responseData.author).to.be.a('string').and.to.have.lengthOf.at.least(1, \"Author should not be empty\");",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"UrlAlbums array is present and contains at least one element\", function () {",
							"    const responseData = pm.response.json();",
							"    ",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.be.an('object');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData.urlAlbums).to.be.an('array');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData.urlAlbums).to.have.lengthOf.at.least(1, \"UrlAlbums array should contain at least one element\");",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"UrlVideoDownload and availableImagesToVideo are boolean values\", function () {",
							"  const responseData = pm.response.json();",
							"  ",
							"  pm.expect(responseData.urlVideoDownload).to.be.a('boolean');",
							"  pm.expect(responseData.availableImagesToVideo).to.be.a('boolean');",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/get?url=https://www.tiktok.com/@tanker_cantik/photo/7428914515011472660",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"get"
					],
					"query": [
						{
							"key": "url",
							"value": "https://www.tiktok.com/@tanker_cantik/photo/7428914515011472660",
							"description": "The URL of the TikTok post you want to download"
						}
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "Convert Slide Image to Video",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Response status code is 200\", function () {",
							"  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Content-Type header is application/json\", function () {",
							"    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.include(\"application/json\");",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Error field is present in the response\", function () {",
							"    const responseData = pm.response.json();",
							"    ",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('error');",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Status_url should be an empty string\", function () {",
							"  const responseData = pm.response.json();",
							"  ",
							"  pm.expect(responseData.status_url).to.be.an('string').that.is.empty;",
							"});",
							"",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Response body structure matches the expected schema\", function () {",
							"    const responseData = pm.response.json();",
							"    ",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.be.an('object');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('error');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData.error).to.be.a('boolean');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData).to.have.property('status_url');",
							"    pm.expect(responseData.status_url).to.be.a('string');",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "token",
						"value": "",
						"type": "text",
						"disabled": true
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\r\n    \"token\": \"eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.________.sUgSW6stff5vxuhhn5JvFlC9CtA3O9UVPb7g6o4PjwU\"\r\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				},
				"url": "{{base_url}}/convert"
			},
			"response": []
		}
	],
